# Software industry mapping for UIA
@prefix sw: <https://ecosystemcode.com/ontology/uia/software#> .
@prefix legacy: <https://example.com/legacy/software#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

legacy:product_client_application owl:equivalentClass sw:ProductClientApplication .
legacy:product_client_application_id rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:productClientApplicationId .
legacy:presents_product_edition rdfs:subPropertyOf sw:presentsProductEdition .
